# ============================================================
# 长桥证券 / Longbridge & LongPort 直连规则
# Source: 各域名官网直接验证（longbridge.com / longbridgeapp.com /
#         longportapp.com / longbridge.sg / longbridge.hk /
#         longbridge.global / longportwhale.com）；
#         longbridge-inc.com：官方帮助中心
#         https://github.com/longbridge/docs（反欺诈页列为官方邮箱域，
#         网络诊断页引用 detect.longbridge-inc.com）
# Retrieved: 2026-11-11
# Policy: overridden by force-policy=proxy
# 变更说明（2026-11-11）：删除 lbtech.hk（HKIRC WHOIS 未注册、
# 公共 DNS NXDOMAIN、证书透明度日志零记录，确属死域名）。
# ============================================================

# 官方网站与主域名
HOST-SUFFIX,longbridge.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,longbridgeapp.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,longportapp.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,longbridge.sg,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,longbridge.hk,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,longbridge.global,no-policy

# 后端 API、行情数据及 OpenAPI 域名
HOST-SUFFIX,longbridge-inc.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,longportwhale.com,no-policy

# 备用关键字匹配（用于拦截可能遗漏的子域名）
HOST-KEYWORD,longbridge,no-policy
HOST-KEYWORD,longport,no-policy
